  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2ee87e681215b6147a44021cf30db039, type: 3}
  m_Name: "5.Ondina and Her Family\u2019s Old Residence (69C Old Mint Street)"
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameOfPoint: "Ondina and Her Family\u2019s Old Residence (69C Old Mint Street)"
  coordinatesPoint: {x: 14.51144, y: 35.899647}
  firstPartInfo: "\u201CI see you\u2019ve been looking around for Ondina. My family
    has been living in this street for generations and my great grandmother told
    me many stories about her. Here\u2019s one. On All Saint\u2019s Day, it was traditional
    for a procession to be held through Old Mint Street. The procession would include
    a statue of the Holy Mary followed by torchbearers. Ondina and the rest of the
    Tayar family lived on the top floor at number 69. Being the clever one, Ondina
    created a game where she would blow out the torches from her balcony without
    her parents noticing.\u201D \r\n\r\nI look up at the topmost balcony. It must
    have been alarming for her parents to risk showing disrespect to the majoring
    community on the island: the Christian community.\r"
  secondPartInfo: A whiff of salty air catches me by surprise. I look down the street.
    The sea must be just behind these houses. Maybe there is a place where I can
    rest after this long journey.
  imgMarker: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c98feaebd40d8df449e6d3855ac84352, type: 3}
  imgMain: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f26fa8880b3aeef4b8516c82dc12f2a5, type: 3}
  nameOfStory: Jewish
  hintOfPOI: "You\u2019re tired? There is a place where humans eat if you keep walking
    towards the seafront. They give me a lot of scraps. The name of it? I\u2019m
    a cat. I can\u2019t read!"
  solutionOfPOI: "Yes, if I can talk then it\u2019s not that weird that I can also
    read. I was just messing with you. It\u2019s called Jews\u2019 Sally Port Caf\xE9."
